  "body": "Values migrated to the v5 schema (controllers/defaultPodOptions/\nglobalMounts); probes, Service, Ingress and volumes render identical to\nbefore. The Deployment selector gains app.kubernetes.io/controller, which\nis immutable, so the Deployment must be deleted before the first sync\n(Recreate strategy, hostPath data is kept). First app of #1992.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n"
